      <div type="clause" n="5.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 5.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ man ælc bebodon fæsten healde mid ælcere geornfulnesse [⁊ ælces Frigedægas fæsten, buton hit freols sy]. [A]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every fast which has been appointed shall be rigorously observed, [and the fast of every Friday, unless it be a festival].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ man beboden fæsten healde mid ælcre geornfulnesse.</ab>
